WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:02.917
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.941 --> 00:04.276
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.300 --> 00:07.516
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.540 --> 00:13.100
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.100 --> 01:31.060
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.220 --> 01:34.460
=Episode 25=

01:36.535 --> 01:37.360
So,

01:37.510 --> 01:38.576
more than twenty years ago,

01:38.600 --> 01:39.640
you went to Wudi City?

01:40.335 --> 01:41.960
We fought in the capital.

01:44.410 --> 01:46.010
Wang Xianzhi was once in the capital?

01:46.635 --> 01:47.856
Why does nobody know that?

01:47.880 --> 01:49.696
Something big happened that night.

01:49.720 --> 01:51.760
Related news has been wiped out.

01:53.760 --> 01:55.635
More than twenty years ago?

01:57.510 --> 01:59.510
What happened in the capital?

02:00.210 --> 02:02.361
If I hadn't run into Wang Xianzhi

02:02.385 --> 02:03.410
that night,

02:03.760 --> 02:04.760
Wu Su

02:05.335 --> 02:07.860
wouldn't have left the capital alive.

02:11.360 --> 02:12.480
Wu Su?

02:15.485 --> 02:16.485
Wu Su...

02:17.685 --> 02:19.085
Consort of the Lord of North Liang?

02:20.635 --> 02:21.635
She could be

02:21.935 --> 02:24.435
the most talented swordswoman

02:24.610 --> 02:26.650
in the Sword Tomb of the Wu Family
over these years.

02:27.035 --> 02:28.395
Consort of the Lord of North Liang

02:29.585 --> 02:31.085
was assassinated in the capital?

02:31.210 --> 02:32.400
Though she was badly wounded,

02:32.510 --> 02:33.960
she managed to leave alive.

02:35.085 --> 02:36.685
Without that assassination,

02:37.010 --> 02:38.640
she wouldn't have died young.

02:39.910 --> 02:41.410
It's such a big incident.

02:42.520 --> 02:44.000
Why has it been so secret?

02:44.720 --> 02:46.056
People succeed by keeping things secret

02:46.080 --> 02:47.360
and fail by giving them away.

02:47.885 --> 02:49.520
Just because it's a big incident,

02:49.880 --> 02:51.240
it has been kept secret.

02:54.585 --> 02:56.025
She was assassinated in the capital.

02:57.360 --> 02:58.910
Was it an order from the late emperor?

03:00.610 --> 03:02.200
Yes, or who would dare to do that?

03:05.410 --> 03:06.960
Liyang was just founded at that time.

03:08.010 --> 03:10.110
Why did the late emperor
try to kill Wu Su?

03:10.760 --> 03:12.410
Xu Xiao made incomparable contributions

03:12.685 --> 03:13.760
by destroying six states.

03:14.035 --> 03:15.315
No award was big enough for him.

03:15.735 --> 03:17.320
Just at that time,

03:18.310 --> 03:21.060
the late emperor was told
that Wu Su was pregnant.

03:21.910 --> 03:22.910
Before that,

03:23.160 --> 03:25.261
Xu Xiao only had daughters.

03:25.285 --> 03:26.786
There wasn't any problem.

03:26.810 --> 03:29.760
But if he had an inheritor
for North Liang,

03:30.210 --> 03:31.400
many people

03:32.685 --> 03:34.260
would be sleepless.

03:36.810 --> 03:38.210
Now that Wu Su wasn't dead,

03:39.435 --> 03:40.880
why didn't Xu Xiao rebel?

03:42.235 --> 03:44.280
The royal family has been anxious
for several years

03:44.610 --> 03:45.800
and this is

03:46.660 --> 03:48.040
what confuses them.

03:49.435 --> 03:51.720
She was assassinated and wounded.

03:52.535 --> 03:54.055
But after she was back in North Liang,

03:54.110 --> 03:55.640
she didn't tell me about it.

03:59.185 --> 04:00.880
I was quite bad-tempered at that time.

04:01.235 --> 04:02.600
If I had known that,

04:02.835 --> 04:05.115
I would fight against the royal family.

04:07.560 --> 04:10.400
When did you know that, then?

04:11.335 --> 04:12.975
After she gave birth to Huangman'er.

04:14.410 --> 04:15.835
I didn't get to know the truth

04:16.585 --> 04:18.085
until her wound re-emerged.

04:18.285 --> 04:19.535
But at that time,

04:20.285 --> 04:22.680
I had my sons and daughters.

04:23.035 --> 04:25.056
You know, when a man with a family

04:25.080 --> 04:26.080
makes a choice,

04:26.285 --> 04:27.810
he has a lot to consider.

04:29.235 --> 04:30.720
She knew me best.

04:31.260 --> 04:33.085
In case I restarted wars,

04:33.660 --> 04:35.280
she didn't tell me the truth

04:35.485 --> 04:37.000
until her last breath.

04:38.960 --> 04:40.040
Throughout my life,

04:40.360 --> 04:42.080
she always knew how to restrain me.

04:44.810 --> 04:47.210
Her Grace was quite well-intentioned.

04:51.885 --> 04:53.016
I promised her

04:53.040 --> 04:54.660
that I wouldn't start wars for her.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.810
But I never said
that I wouldn't take revenge.

05:00.985 --> 05:02.296
She didn't tell me

05:02.320 --> 05:03.800
who assassinated her.

05:04.710 --> 05:06.035
Then I've kept investigating.

05:06.760 --> 05:08.000
No matter who assassinated her,

05:08.385 --> 05:10.160
I wouldn't let him go.

05:12.860 --> 05:13.860
Yang Taisui,

05:15.010 --> 05:16.610
I'm telling you this

05:17.635 --> 05:20.185
because I want you
to know how determined I am.

05:23.560 --> 05:24.585
Now,

05:26.435 --> 05:28.120
tell me who did that.

05:32.360 --> 05:33.985
Wang Xianzhi…

05:34.510 --> 05:36.460
…appeared in the capital that night.

05:37.335 --> 05:39.260
Wang Xianzhi in Wudi City?

05:42.960 --> 05:45.120
I didn't want to tell you that,

05:45.710 --> 05:47.880
because I always found it fishy.

05:49.335 --> 05:52.240
Her Grace had excellent swordsmanship.

05:52.535 --> 05:54.486
But she wasn't able

05:54.510 --> 05:56.160
to flee from Wang Xianzhi.

05:58.185 --> 06:00.610
Only three or four swordsmen

06:01.360 --> 06:02.810
are able to fight Wang Xianzhi.

06:04.485 --> 06:08.040
If Wang Xianzhi had fought Her Grace,

06:08.460 --> 06:11.640
she wouldn't be able
to leave the capital alive.

06:15.535 --> 06:16.810
One more thing.

06:17.085 --> 06:19.040
I was just informed.

06:19.585 --> 06:22.880
As soon as His Highness decided
to visit Wudi City,

06:23.285 --> 06:24.810
I was told

06:24.985 --> 06:27.835
that Wang Xianzhi appeared that night.

06:28.435 --> 06:30.600
What a coincidence!

06:31.460 --> 06:33.185
Is it true or false?

06:33.385 --> 06:35.560
I had it confirmed. It's true.

06:40.835 --> 06:42.535
The one who informed you

06:42.935 --> 06:45.510
expected me to rush to Wudi City.

06:45.810 --> 06:47.936
It would be better
if Wang Xianzhi killed me.

06:47.960 --> 06:48.600
Then,

06:48.885 --> 06:51.320
everybody would be satisfied.

06:52.110 --> 06:54.410
I'm glad you understand that.

06:56.685 --> 06:58.636
Do you have pigeons
that can fly to Jiangnan?

06:58.660 --> 06:59.660
Lend one to me.

07:01.410 --> 07:03.800
Fengnian is going to Wudi City, anyway.

07:03.910 --> 07:05.435
He can ask Wang Xianzhi personally.

07:09.335 --> 07:10.935
Wang Xianzhi

07:11.735 --> 07:13.160
is quite moody.

07:13.635 --> 07:14.936
But His Highness is...

07:14.960 --> 07:15.960
Domineering.

07:16.835 --> 07:17.860
I'm afraid

07:18.660 --> 07:20.585
His Highness will be hurt.

07:22.035 --> 07:23.280
You don't understand.

07:24.110 --> 07:26.230
If I didn't tell him about this,

07:26.960 --> 07:28.640
he would hate me.

07:30.910 --> 07:32.410
In his heart,

07:33.135 --> 07:34.585
he could never get over

07:35.185 --> 07:37.285
the death of his mother.

07:53.935 --> 07:56.110
If you can't leave Mount Longhu,

07:56.410 --> 07:57.560
I've got another plan.

07:58.135 --> 07:59.360
Xu Fengnian and his men

07:59.610 --> 08:01.016
will pass Mount Longhu

08:01.040 --> 08:02.400
to visit his brother Xu Longxiang.

08:02.860 --> 08:05.060
I'll lure him here

08:05.360 --> 08:06.720
so that you can kill him.

08:08.610 --> 08:09.776
I'm not sure

08:09.800 --> 08:11.785
whether I can defeat Li Chungang.

08:12.260 --> 08:14.410
Is he really that horrible?

08:15.435 --> 08:16.435
Besides,

08:16.485 --> 08:18.520
we can't kill Xu Fengnian.

08:19.635 --> 08:22.810
Liyang is too weak to get over
the rebellion of North Liang.

08:24.285 --> 08:25.885
Xu Fengnian

08:26.685 --> 08:28.160
keeps his talent under wraps.

08:29.035 --> 08:30.640
He's never a real playboy.

08:30.885 --> 08:31.885
Mm.

08:32.485 --> 08:34.080
If he takes over North Liang,

08:34.160 --> 08:35.520
he'll be a big threat.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.360
We can't kill him,

08:41.935 --> 08:43.335
but we can destroy him.

08:43.635 --> 08:44.720
How?

08:44.860 --> 08:45.860
Look.

08:46.185 --> 08:47.496
There's a rock.

08:47.520 --> 08:48.685
Remove it.

08:54.810 --> 08:55.935
Open it and read.

09:02.760 --> 09:04.110
Biography of Wu Su?

09:04.510 --> 09:05.936
(Biography of Wu Su)
What can it be used for?

09:05.960 --> 09:08.880
When I want to control someone,

09:09.035 --> 09:10.085
the most important thing

09:10.910 --> 09:12.600
is to disturb him.

09:13.610 --> 09:16.640
You were shocked by the imperial seal

09:17.010 --> 09:18.735
so that you had a dream quickly.

09:19.810 --> 09:21.200
Because in your heart,

09:21.360 --> 09:24.260
you care about imperial power most.

09:26.085 --> 09:27.460
As for Xu Fengnian...

09:27.885 --> 09:29.416
I've read

09:29.440 --> 09:30.735
about his experiences.

09:31.960 --> 09:34.000
It's easy to tell from the details

09:34.185 --> 09:36.945
that Wu Su is precious

09:37.160 --> 09:38.720
in his heart.

09:40.835 --> 09:42.400
So, this biography

09:42.860 --> 09:45.260
will easily disturb Xu Fengnian.

09:45.285 --> 09:46.285
Mm.

09:46.735 --> 09:48.286
Words aren't enough.

09:48.310 --> 09:50.061
(Biography of Wu Su)
On some pieces of paper,

09:50.085 --> 09:52.000
(Biography of Wu Su)
there are special patterns.

09:52.410 --> 09:53.440
I don't need

09:53.810 --> 09:56.280
to use this skill by myself.

09:57.000 --> 09:58.000
The patterns

09:58.110 --> 10:00.016
will influence a man's emotions

10:00.040 --> 10:02.440
without being noticed.

10:04.410 --> 10:07.185
Why do I feel nothing when reading it?

10:07.785 --> 10:09.000
This is designed

10:09.210 --> 10:11.096
for Xu Fengnian only.

10:11.120 --> 10:13.840
Others won't be influenced.

10:14.710 --> 10:16.040
For him only?

10:16.435 --> 10:18.880
I have to know
the detailed life of a man

10:19.135 --> 10:20.211
before I design the patterns

10:20.235 --> 10:22.240
that can influence him

10:22.935 --> 10:25.000
and hurt his emotions secretly.

10:26.160 --> 10:28.856
After Xu Fengnian reads it,
he'll have a nightmare?

10:28.880 --> 10:29.720
No.

10:29.835 --> 10:31.720
It'll get him stuck in memories.

10:32.135 --> 10:35.260
In his dream, he'll see the one
he's eager to see.

10:36.035 --> 10:37.035
How can a dream

10:38.035 --> 10:39.320
hurt him?

10:40.860 --> 10:43.135
I'll destroy Wu Su in his heart.

10:43.710 --> 10:45.936
The assassination in the capital

10:45.960 --> 10:47.280
is recorded on the previous page.

10:47.610 --> 10:50.260
(Biography of Wu Su)
It's very important to Xu Fengnian.

10:50.385 --> 10:51.856
When he reads this,

10:51.880 --> 10:53.080
he'll feel the most disturbed.

10:53.520 --> 10:55.960
When he suddenly sees this picture,

10:56.485 --> 10:58.880
he'll be deeply impressed.

11:00.185 --> 11:01.185
And then?

11:01.510 --> 11:02.750
Then, he'll get into his dream.

11:02.885 --> 11:04.361
The dragon in this picture

11:04.385 --> 11:06.160
will flash in his heart

11:06.435 --> 11:08.440
and cut off his reliance.

11:08.860 --> 11:10.000
In other words,

11:10.485 --> 11:11.735
I'll make Wu Su

11:12.560 --> 11:14.280
die again in front of his eyes.

11:15.885 --> 11:17.535
Xu Fengnian will break down

11:17.835 --> 11:20.760
unless he's super strong mentally.

11:22.160 --> 11:25.760
He may become insane as well.

11:27.010 --> 11:28.920
When Xu Fengnian becomes
the Lord of North Liang

11:29.185 --> 11:32.000
as an insane man,

11:32.210 --> 11:33.760
isn't it the best result

11:35.560 --> 11:37.600
for the royal family?

11:41.035 --> 11:42.840
What if he's super strong mentally?

11:44.060 --> 11:45.210
One man in a million

11:45.410 --> 11:46.960
can be super strong mentally.

11:47.260 --> 11:49.720
Xu Fengnian can't be.

11:52.610 --> 11:54.400
You've been preparing for this?

11:55.760 --> 11:57.685
Even if I spend my life
in the mountains,

11:58.310 --> 11:59.610
I'm from the royal family,

12:00.635 --> 12:01.985
after all.

12:20.660 --> 12:21.811
I'm leaving immediately

12:21.835 --> 12:23.040
and I'll have this big present

12:23.135 --> 12:24.960
sent to Xu Fengnian.

12:25.660 --> 12:28.660
If Xu Fengnian gets over it,

12:29.060 --> 12:30.935
bring him here!

12:37.160 --> 12:38.400
Here's your decoction, My Lady.

12:45.910 --> 12:46.961
Put more sugar in it.

12:46.985 --> 12:47.985
Mm.

12:51.135 --> 12:52.385
I'm scared of bitterness.

12:52.610 --> 12:53.960
What disease do you have?

12:53.985 --> 12:55.625
You keep drinking the decoction
every day.

12:58.585 --> 12:59.585
Touch my hand.

13:04.060 --> 13:05.435
I'm weak.

13:06.535 --> 13:08.910
Even in summer,
my hands and feet are cold.

13:09.210 --> 13:10.640
I'm often out of spirits.

13:12.735 --> 13:14.520
You need to see a good doctor.

13:14.935 --> 13:15.897
They can't help.

13:15.921 --> 13:17.010
I've seen doctors.

13:17.260 --> 13:19.000
Even famous doctors say

13:19.320 --> 13:20.640
that the deficiency of spirit

13:21.185 --> 13:22.210
can't be cured.

13:23.885 --> 13:24.885
Sister,

13:25.585 --> 13:27.285
go back to North Liang with me.

13:31.135 --> 13:32.835
Didn't we make a deal on that?

13:32.985 --> 13:34.336
I have to stay.

13:34.360 --> 13:34.936
But Sister...

13:34.960 --> 13:35.960
Enough.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.185
How about this?

13:38.810 --> 13:40.336
When you take over North Liang,

13:40.360 --> 13:41.785
come and take me home.

13:44.410 --> 13:45.410
Sure.

13:45.610 --> 13:46.610
It's a deal, then.

13:48.860 --> 13:49.860
All right.

13:50.085 --> 13:51.325
Forget it.

13:52.635 --> 13:54.460
Now that you're nearly recovered,

13:55.235 --> 13:56.236
think about

13:56.260 --> 13:58.136
how to fall out
with scholars in Jiangnan

13:58.160 --> 13:59.800
so that the royal family
will be relieved.

14:00.585 --> 14:02.240
I must be patient.

14:02.560 --> 14:03.840
I need a chance.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.960
What chance?

14:06.960 --> 14:08.640
Scholars in Jiangnan
often have gatherings.

14:08.785 --> 14:10.960
I'll break in and make a scene.

14:11.385 --> 14:13.160
The scholars will hate me

14:13.360 --> 14:14.880
and I'll be rude and proud.

14:15.035 --> 14:16.035
I can have it both ways.

14:17.785 --> 14:19.816
But you can't always debase yourself.

14:19.840 --> 14:21.160
Like you said,

14:21.885 --> 14:23.480
I don't care

14:23.760 --> 14:25.120
how irrelevant people think of me.

14:25.635 --> 14:27.195
All I need is your understanding.

14:40.185 --> 14:41.087
My Lady.

14:41.111 --> 14:42.210
Grandpa Wei.

14:44.910 --> 14:46.010
She has come again.

14:47.210 --> 14:48.210
Where's she?

14:48.410 --> 14:49.720
Outside the door.

14:50.060 --> 14:51.536
She's waiting for you, I guess.

14:51.560 --> 14:52.457
Shall I...?

14:52.481 --> 14:53.610
Shall I expel her?

14:54.185 --> 14:55.786
Sister, I'll go have a look.

14:55.810 --> 14:56.810
All right.

15:07.160 --> 15:08.160
You killer!

15:08.335 --> 15:09.435
I'm going to kill you!

15:19.210 --> 15:20.210
Want to kill me?

15:20.560 --> 15:21.537
I killed Liu Liting,

15:21.561 --> 15:23.035
because he deserved it.

15:23.635 --> 15:24.635
I don't regret it.

15:24.860 --> 15:27.185
You hate me for sure.

15:27.335 --> 15:28.335
I understand that.

15:28.810 --> 15:30.311
Your family is powerful.

15:30.335 --> 15:31.936
You killed my husband on the street,

15:31.960 --> 15:32.737
but no one of the local government

15:32.761 --> 15:34.560
dared to take up the case!

15:34.910 --> 15:36.060
I'm not proud of that.

15:36.635 --> 15:38.960
When laws are partial to noble people,

15:39.685 --> 15:40.760
I'm very disappointed.

15:42.685 --> 15:43.776
To report what you did,

15:43.800 --> 15:45.560
I've sent a letter to the capital.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.000
It won't be a few days

15:47.185 --> 15:48.735
before you get what you deserve.

15:49.585 --> 15:52.035
You sent the letter to the consort
of your clan, right?

15:55.210 --> 15:56.635
I was just informed

15:57.110 --> 15:58.986
that she fell in disfavor.

15:59.010 --> 16:00.160
Nonsense!

16:00.200 --> 16:01.680
Why would I talk nonsense about that?

16:01.860 --> 16:03.086
I'm more well-informed than you.

16:03.110 --> 16:04.170
In a couple of days,

16:04.260 --> 16:05.520
you'll be informed, too.

16:08.085 --> 16:09.411
Why would that happen?

16:09.435 --> 16:10.435
The reason is easy.

16:10.960 --> 16:13.036
Because His Majesty doesn't want
to fall out with North Liang

16:13.060 --> 16:14.480
just for you.

16:16.310 --> 16:18.320
I feel sorry about that, too.

16:19.710 --> 16:21.760
I killed Liu Liting
for the right reason.

16:22.035 --> 16:23.416
I was waiting to confront you at court

16:23.440 --> 16:24.860
and vindicate my sister.

16:25.110 --> 16:26.635
I didn't expect the government

16:26.760 --> 16:28.360
to hold down the case directly.

16:29.335 --> 16:31.910
It's quite disappointing.

16:33.660 --> 16:35.335
Keep showing off.

16:35.960 --> 16:36.937
One day,

16:36.961 --> 16:38.520
your crimes will be inexpiable!

16:38.660 --> 16:40.480
I'm not showing off or satirizing you.

16:40.735 --> 16:42.360
I really mean that.

16:42.960 --> 16:44.040
I also don't think

16:44.135 --> 16:45.560
it's evil to kill Liu Liting.

16:46.785 --> 16:48.735
It was his plot

16:48.910 --> 16:51.280
to kill my sister by the hand of rites.

16:52.410 --> 16:53.985
Nonsense!

16:54.210 --> 16:55.137
This is all I can tell you.

16:55.161 --> 16:56.260
I'm going to say no more.

16:58.110 --> 16:59.400
Don't come again.

17:03.435 --> 17:05.440
You can't kill me.

17:23.285 --> 17:26.435
Even if I die, I won't let you go!

17:28.210 --> 17:30.160
She was deceived by Liu Liting.

17:30.510 --> 17:32.085
She shouldn't be killed for that.

17:35.135 --> 17:36.835
But I'm afraid she will try to kill you

17:37.260 --> 17:39.000
from this day on.

17:40.210 --> 17:41.370
She wouldn't want to live on,

17:41.535 --> 17:43.085
without hatred.

17:47.735 --> 17:48.735
Master,

17:49.860 --> 17:51.860
Liu Liting's wife has come again.

17:52.110 --> 17:53.616
Liu Liting used many schemes

17:53.640 --> 17:55.160
to debase our family.

17:55.960 --> 17:57.035
He deserved to be killed.

17:57.660 --> 17:59.960
Xu Fengnian went out to see her.

18:00.935 --> 18:02.385
Is he going to kill her?

18:02.635 --> 18:03.860
No.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.311
He said something to her

18:05.335 --> 18:06.785
and then she left.

18:08.710 --> 18:09.790
Keep an eye on him.

18:10.485 --> 18:13.080
Don't let him kill her.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.310
Yes.

18:14.435 --> 18:15.435
Also,

18:16.585 --> 18:17.635
tell my family members

18:18.510 --> 18:20.435
not to be harsh on Xu Zhihu.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.480
She's a poor lady, too.

18:22.610 --> 18:24.035
You make sense.

18:25.235 --> 18:26.235
Someone...

18:29.510 --> 18:30.685
Just say it.

18:31.835 --> 18:33.400
A maid in the backyard saw

18:33.685 --> 18:35.880
that Xu Fengnian brought two girls here.

18:36.260 --> 18:37.310
She said,

18:37.860 --> 18:40.535
one of the girls

18:40.760 --> 18:42.560
might be from West Chu.

18:48.135 --> 18:49.097
What you asked for the other day

18:49.121 --> 18:50.616
has been handled.

18:50.640 --> 18:52.040
The carriage is near the back door.

18:52.285 --> 18:53.525
No one in the Lu Family saw it.

18:53.910 --> 18:54.910
Shall we

18:55.835 --> 18:56.835
go have a look?

19:01.760 --> 19:02.760
Master.

19:03.485 --> 19:04.636
The other day,

19:04.660 --> 19:07.056
when I gave the monthly pay
to Xu Zhihu...

19:07.080 --> 19:08.110
Call her Young Mistress.

19:09.085 --> 19:10.085
Right, right.

19:10.610 --> 19:12.880
When I gave the monthly pay
to Young Mistress,

19:13.760 --> 19:15.816
I ran into the two girls

19:15.840 --> 19:17.200
brought by Xu Fengnian.

19:18.135 --> 19:20.855
They were wearing the veil.

19:22.560 --> 19:24.656
I thought about one of them these days

19:24.680 --> 19:25.920
and I found her familiar.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.640
You think she's from West Chu?

19:27.935 --> 19:28.935
Yes.

19:29.985 --> 19:31.265
You've met people from West Chu?

19:32.110 --> 19:33.110
Yes.

19:33.410 --> 19:35.610
The Eldest Master once visited West Chu.

19:35.660 --> 19:37.936
I accompanied him and took care of him.

19:37.960 --> 19:38.960
Get to the point.

19:40.760 --> 19:43.320
The royal family of West Chu
held a banquet for us.

19:43.720 --> 19:47.280
A swordswoman performed a sword dance.

19:48.235 --> 19:50.320
The girl around Xu Fengnian

19:50.910 --> 19:52.586
looks like that swordswoman

19:52.610 --> 19:55.200
in appearance and temperament.

19:56.960 --> 19:58.535
You simply judge her

20:00.185 --> 20:01.860
by appearance?

20:02.935 --> 20:05.185
When I was watching the sword dance
in the corridor,

20:05.485 --> 20:06.736
I saw a little girl of West Chu

20:06.760 --> 20:08.600
standing among the servants.

20:08.985 --> 20:10.710
She was watching the dance, too.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.285
I remember clearly

20:12.535 --> 20:15.260
that she was holding a little white cat.

20:15.560 --> 20:18.560
The girl around Xu Fengnian

20:18.885 --> 20:20.510
holds a white cat, too.

20:22.135 --> 20:24.360
And they look alike.

20:24.760 --> 20:27.810
Isn't it a coincidence?

20:28.720 --> 20:29.835
It doesn't make sense.

20:31.360 --> 20:33.600
Xu Xiao destroyed West Chu.

20:34.710 --> 20:35.856
Why would a descendant of West Chu

20:35.880 --> 20:37.960
stay around Xu Fengnian?

20:38.285 --> 20:39.285
Besides,

20:39.480 --> 20:40.377
Xu Xiao knows

20:40.401 --> 20:42.480
my family hates West Chu.

20:42.560 --> 20:44.640
Why would Xu Fengnian
bring such a girl to Jiangnan?

20:47.135 --> 20:48.135
Go.

20:48.485 --> 20:49.560
Take me to check the place

20:49.885 --> 20:51.435
where the girls live.

20:54.235 --> 20:55.286
The girls

20:55.310 --> 20:56.985
used to live here.

20:57.660 --> 20:58.840
Their luggage is gone.

20:59.835 --> 21:00.760
Go ask about it.

21:00.800 --> 21:01.800
Yes.

21:13.685 --> 21:16.136
Why must we move out without a reason?

21:16.160 --> 21:17.520
It's an order from His Highness.

21:18.635 --> 21:20.600
Why doesn't he move out?

21:21.585 --> 21:23.110
I'm not scared of the Lu Family.

21:23.435 --> 21:24.435
Your Highness.

21:26.985 --> 21:29.110
Why am I scared of the Lu Family?

21:30.335 --> 21:32.096
The lineal son of the Lu Family
joined the army

21:32.120 --> 21:33.611
and died in the battle against West Chu.

21:33.635 --> 21:35.810
So, they hate you greatly.

21:37.085 --> 21:38.576
But it was a long time ago.

21:38.600 --> 21:41.400
Why are you as nagging as Yu Youwei?

21:42.010 --> 21:42.537
What?

21:42.561 --> 21:43.910
I thought about it carefully.

21:44.235 --> 21:46.080
Xu Xiao has never
done anything unnecessary.

21:46.460 --> 21:47.480
What's your point?

21:48.460 --> 21:50.336
He looks casual in doing anything.

21:50.360 --> 21:52.480
But he always has a perfect plan
with secret meanings.

21:53.135 --> 21:54.576
Since Lyu Qiantang died,

21:54.600 --> 21:56.120
I've been thinking about one question.

21:56.785 --> 21:58.065
Why did he ask you and Yu Youwei

21:58.335 --> 22:00.060
to go east with me?

22:01.710 --> 22:03.640
Why do you think?

22:04.485 --> 22:05.896
For the inheritance of North Liang.

22:05.920 --> 22:07.800
Xu Xiao wants me to fall out
with the Lu Family.

22:08.435 --> 22:09.840
But he knows me.

22:10.085 --> 22:11.410
I won't embarrass my sister.

22:13.485 --> 22:14.925
Let's assume this.

22:15.385 --> 22:17.145
If the Lu Family recognizes you

22:17.285 --> 22:18.656
or Yu Youwei,

22:18.680 --> 22:19.720
what will happen?

22:21.110 --> 22:23.611
They'll kill us for revenge.

22:23.635 --> 22:25.640
Then, I'll fall out with them.

22:25.810 --> 22:27.890
His plan to make me inherit
the throne of North Liang

22:28.285 --> 22:29.385
will be working.

22:30.535 --> 22:31.640
What did I say?

22:31.760 --> 22:34.280
He must have got a scheme
when he asked us to travel with you.

22:36.360 --> 22:37.496
Xu Xiao always says

22:37.520 --> 22:39.480
that we can pay any price
to achieve what we want.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.760
During this trip,

22:41.010 --> 22:42.885
you're the price to pay, I'm afraid.

22:45.735 --> 22:48.435
Why didn't you let us leave until today?

22:49.035 --> 22:50.336
I didn't figure out this secret plan

22:50.360 --> 22:52.040
until I stayed for recuperation
these days.

22:52.360 --> 22:53.336
No matter whether it's Xu Xiao's scheme,

22:53.360 --> 22:54.360
you must be very careful.

22:55.285 --> 22:56.176
I've asked Fengzi Battalion

22:56.200 --> 22:57.240
to find a shelter for you.

22:57.285 --> 22:58.525
Hide yourselves for the moment.

22:59.085 --> 23:00.560
After we leave Jiangnan together,

23:00.760 --> 23:02.120
everything will go smoothly.

23:08.710 --> 23:09.435
Master,

23:09.685 --> 23:10.560
I asked about it.

23:10.635 --> 23:11.935
They just moved out.

23:15.560 --> 23:17.360
If they were clean,

23:18.135 --> 23:19.360
why would Xu Fengnian

23:19.635 --> 23:21.635
let them move out of my mansion?

23:22.810 --> 23:24.085
Looks like

23:24.285 --> 23:26.635
there's something fishy with them.

23:28.160 --> 23:28.897
Shall we

23:28.921 --> 23:30.616
get them back and recognize them?

23:30.640 --> 23:32.160
No one shall bring it up again.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.610
Are we just letting them go?

23:36.010 --> 23:37.635
If they're indeed from West Chu,

23:38.085 --> 23:39.910
they have a blood feud with us.

23:42.210 --> 23:43.850
We can't have a direct conflict
with them.

23:45.760 --> 23:47.160
Someone has to recognize them.

23:47.685 --> 23:49.785
But it can't be anyone

23:50.635 --> 23:51.860
from my family.

23:52.510 --> 23:53.335
Master,

23:53.510 --> 23:55.135
what's your plan, then?

24:05.885 --> 24:07.010
I need your help

24:07.635 --> 24:08.835
with a scheme.

24:12.910 --> 24:15.985
Your family and North Liang
are birds of a feather.

24:16.210 --> 24:17.017
What?

24:17.041 --> 24:18.480
Killing my husband isn't enough?

24:21.560 --> 24:23.235
What if

24:23.860 --> 24:26.385
it's a scheme against Xu Fengnian?

24:28.285 --> 24:29.435
That's impossible.

24:29.810 --> 24:31.360
You are relatives by marriage.

24:32.635 --> 24:33.635
Right.

24:34.485 --> 24:35.835
We're relatives by marriage.

24:36.835 --> 24:38.080
I've been kind

24:38.760 --> 24:40.200
to Xu Zhihu, too.

24:40.560 --> 24:41.560
However,

24:42.135 --> 24:44.600
if they cross the line of my family,

24:45.985 --> 24:47.080
I won't be nice anymore.

24:48.835 --> 24:50.435
Your husband died.

24:51.510 --> 24:53.080
My brother died, too.

24:54.110 --> 24:55.360
Many things

24:56.085 --> 24:57.120
won't be let go

24:58.485 --> 24:59.840
even after many years.

25:03.885 --> 25:04.910
What scheme?

25:31.335 --> 25:33.360
Don't go out these days.

25:33.485 --> 25:35.645
If they want to find us,
they will find us.

25:36.735 --> 25:38.255
Why is the Lu Family looking for you?

25:38.835 --> 25:40.080
You're mere maids.

25:40.160 --> 25:42.985
If Xu Xiao wants to give me
to the Lu Family,

25:43.535 --> 25:44.785
moving won't help at all.

25:46.210 --> 25:47.570
His Highness will protect you.

25:51.135 --> 25:52.135
What about you?

25:52.860 --> 25:54.260
If Xu Xiao also gives you an order,

25:54.385 --> 25:55.485
whose order will you take?

25:55.660 --> 25:56.960
Dregs of West Chu?

25:57.535 --> 25:58.610
I'm not sure yet.

25:59.410 --> 26:00.480
I must find them

26:01.200 --> 26:02.200
and interrogate them.

26:02.385 --> 26:03.880
What do you want me for?

26:04.210 --> 26:05.177
In Yangcheng,

26:05.201 --> 26:07.040
you can find anyone you want.

26:07.810 --> 26:09.960
Yes, if we have many people
look for them.

26:11.135 --> 26:12.455
But if we make a big thing of it,

26:13.310 --> 26:14.320
how will we end up?

26:15.535 --> 26:17.060
You're scared of North Liang?

26:17.320 --> 26:19.160
There are 350,000 soldiers
in North Liang Army.

26:19.685 --> 26:20.840
Who isn't scared?

26:21.285 --> 26:23.200
Before I confirm who the two maids are,

26:24.060 --> 26:25.286
I can't fall out with them.

26:25.310 --> 26:27.110
You want me to find them for you?

26:27.560 --> 26:28.335
No.

26:28.535 --> 26:30.060
What do you want, then?

26:31.710 --> 26:32.810
I want you

26:33.135 --> 26:34.520
to hold a debate.

26:35.110 --> 26:36.616
Invite all scholars in Jiangnan,

26:36.640 --> 26:38.840
except for my family.

26:40.560 --> 26:41.360
Where shall I hold it?

26:41.560 --> 26:42.560
In Baoguo Temple.

26:46.260 --> 26:47.310
As for the time...

26:47.885 --> 26:48.885
Let's make it

26:49.210 --> 26:50.400
in five days.

26:52.110 --> 26:53.120
Where are you going?

26:53.410 --> 26:54.410
I'll keep going east.

26:54.960 --> 26:57.240
We're going to visit Huangman'er
on Mount Longhu

26:57.360 --> 26:59.186
and visit my second eldest sister
in Shangyin Academy.

26:59.210 --> 27:00.811
But you're still wounded.

27:00.835 --> 27:01.985
It has recovered.

27:02.385 --> 27:03.461
After two changes of dressing,

27:03.485 --> 27:05.520
I can leave in four or five days.

27:07.885 --> 27:09.405
Sister, if you don't want me to leave,

27:09.485 --> 27:10.710
go with me.

27:11.885 --> 27:14.080
I'm married and I can't leave.

27:14.810 --> 27:16.400
When you take over North Liang,

27:16.785 --> 27:18.160
come and take me home.

27:18.860 --> 27:20.435
We made the deal, didn't we?

27:21.310 --> 27:22.336
Wait for me, then.

27:22.360 --> 27:23.360
Mm.

27:26.110 --> 27:27.296
Do remember

27:27.320 --> 27:28.376
to make a scene in Jiangnan

27:28.400 --> 27:29.680
before you leave.

27:30.235 --> 27:32.561
Only in this way will the royal family
let you inherit North Liang.

27:32.585 --> 27:33.585
Don't worry.

27:33.960 --> 27:35.496
My men are asking about
the literary gathering

27:35.520 --> 27:36.800
in recent days.

27:38.860 --> 27:40.685
And Jiang Ni...

27:41.960 --> 27:43.240
Be very careful.

27:43.360 --> 27:45.320
Don't let the Lu Family
know her identity.

27:45.385 --> 27:47.185
I won't let her
come to the Lu Family anymore.

27:51.360 --> 27:52.680
West Chu has been destroyed.

27:55.085 --> 27:57.416
Otherwise, Jiang Ni would be
good enough for you

27:57.440 --> 27:58.760
considering she was the princess.

27:59.435 --> 28:00.800
What are you talking about?

28:01.535 --> 28:03.235
I understand even if you never say it.

28:03.535 --> 28:04.760
In your heart,

28:04.800 --> 28:06.860
Jiang Ni is different from other girls.

28:07.835 --> 28:09.810
But I'm afraid

28:10.785 --> 28:12.660
Father has an arrangement
for your marriage.

28:13.535 --> 28:14.860
I don't think

28:15.235 --> 28:17.035
Jiang Ni can marry you.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.560
Xu Xiao can't arrange my marriage.

28:18.760 --> 28:19.616
It's my life

28:19.640 --> 28:20.640
and I pick my own wife.

28:20.710 --> 28:23.285
You've been at odds
with Father since you were little.

28:23.435 --> 28:24.811
I can't do anything to change that.

28:24.835 --> 28:25.696
He and I just don't get along.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.535
Nonsense!

28:26.735 --> 28:28.110
You're father and son.

28:29.660 --> 28:30.660
Fengnian,

28:32.585 --> 28:34.160
you can't blame Father

28:34.560 --> 28:35.462
for Mother's death.

28:35.486 --> 28:36.800
Say no more about it.

28:38.635 --> 28:39.696
You haven't let it go,

28:39.720 --> 28:41.260
have you?

28:42.535 --> 28:43.800
It's been so many years.

28:44.810 --> 28:45.810
Look.

28:46.660 --> 28:47.740
I'm all right.

28:53.710 --> 28:55.885
(Cries of Crane)

29:07.285 --> 29:08.285
Senior.

29:09.935 --> 29:10.935
Mm.

29:12.285 --> 29:13.410
You've put away

29:13.585 --> 29:14.536
the Divine Token?

29:14.560 --> 29:15.560
Or what?

29:15.760 --> 29:18.135
Shall I wear it so that
the Lu Family will recognize me?

29:18.320 --> 29:19.320
So,

29:19.560 --> 29:20.760
you've been on alert.

29:20.960 --> 29:22.200
Did Xu Fengnian

29:22.335 --> 29:23.810
ask you to remind me?

29:25.635 --> 29:27.035
His Lordship

29:27.285 --> 29:28.460
wants a favor from you.

29:31.060 --> 29:32.060
Xu Xiao?

29:35.135 --> 29:36.760
His Lordship is working

29:37.010 --> 29:38.010
on what he promised you.

29:38.085 --> 29:39.485
Please rest assured.

29:41.035 --> 29:43.040
Xu Xiao sent you a message
from the capital?

29:43.935 --> 29:44.935
Nowadays,

29:45.235 --> 29:46.785
everyone keeps some pigeons.

29:48.510 --> 29:49.720
Does Xu Fengnian know that?

29:53.210 --> 29:54.635
Looks like he doesn't.

29:56.710 --> 29:58.010
What does Xu Xiao want?

30:02.335 --> 30:03.375
His Lordship

30:03.685 --> 30:05.560
wants to borrow something from you.

30:08.685 --> 30:09.685
This?

30:19.360 --> 30:21.235
(Yangcheng)

30:29.060 --> 30:31.460
(Cries of Crane)

30:34.935 --> 30:36.161
It's you, Mr. Wei?

30:36.185 --> 30:38.520
Why haven't I seen you these days?

30:38.560 --> 30:40.686
I've been running around,

30:40.710 --> 30:42.235
to get information for His Highness.

30:42.335 --> 30:43.087
Look.

30:43.111 --> 30:44.551
I've got something to report to him.

30:44.660 --> 30:45.785
I think

30:46.060 --> 30:47.885
His Highness is in Lady Zhihu's room.

30:50.560 --> 30:51.560
Go ahead.

30:53.585 --> 30:56.085
Were you talking to the God of Sword?

31:04.835 --> 31:06.335
Why did you ask?

31:07.210 --> 31:08.935
Do you think

31:09.835 --> 31:11.010
he will instruct me?

31:15.210 --> 31:15.960
Instruct you?

31:16.160 --> 31:17.860
He's the God of Sword.

31:18.035 --> 31:19.610
If he can instruct me,

31:20.010 --> 31:21.200
I'll get a lot of benefits.

31:22.285 --> 31:23.435
You have to

31:24.735 --> 31:25.860
ask him by yourself.

31:26.385 --> 31:27.640
I don't dare to.

31:27.960 --> 31:29.460
The God of Sword

31:29.710 --> 31:31.960
is said to be like an immortal.

31:33.185 --> 31:34.760
But Mr. Wei,

31:35.535 --> 31:36.760
you're familiar with him.

31:36.910 --> 31:37.910
You get it wrong.

31:38.010 --> 31:39.485
I'm not familiar with him.

31:39.710 --> 31:41.036
We weren't talking, either.

31:41.060 --> 31:42.296
I was just borrowing something

31:42.320 --> 31:43.320
from him.

31:43.560 --> 31:44.211
Borrowing something?

31:44.235 --> 31:45.235
Mm.

31:45.435 --> 31:46.435
What is it?

31:48.835 --> 31:50.435
You have something to tell His Highness,

31:50.685 --> 31:52.185
don't you?

31:52.860 --> 31:53.860
I'm going out

31:54.335 --> 31:55.760
for a stroll on the street.

32:06.085 --> 32:08.210
(Cries of Crane)

32:10.835 --> 32:13.360
(Mansion of Lu)

32:45.735 --> 32:46.935
What's in the box?

32:47.735 --> 32:49.235
You stabbed Xu Fengnian?

32:50.635 --> 32:52.285
Unfortunately, he isn't dead yet.

32:55.060 --> 32:56.735
If you really want to kill Xu Fengnian,

32:57.360 --> 32:59.210
we can cooperate.

33:00.635 --> 33:01.680
I don't want it.

33:04.360 --> 33:05.936
If you want the money reward,

33:05.960 --> 33:07.920
I can give it all to you.

33:08.810 --> 33:09.537
After we make it,

33:09.561 --> 33:11.040
I can even give you more money.

33:11.535 --> 33:12.535
I don't believe you.

33:12.585 --> 33:13.635
What do you want, then?

33:13.785 --> 33:15.785
Xu Fengnian is my prey.

33:15.935 --> 33:18.000
No one else can touch him.

33:23.535 --> 33:25.600
It's overbearing of you.

33:27.260 --> 33:30.480
Shall we have a fight?

33:32.135 --> 33:33.660
After he leaves Yangcheng,

33:35.085 --> 33:36.085
you and I

33:37.335 --> 33:38.760
shall take action separately.

33:42.160 --> 33:42.862
Wait.

33:42.886 --> 33:44.960
You haven't told me what's in the box.

33:55.535 --> 33:56.610
Bear it.

33:57.160 --> 33:57.937
It's bitter.

33:57.961 --> 33:59.361
But you have to drink it every day.

33:59.710 --> 34:00.710
Your Highness.

34:01.260 --> 34:02.260
Come on in.

34:08.410 --> 34:09.410
My Lady.

34:09.735 --> 34:10.735
What's up?

34:10.810 --> 34:11.560
Your Highness,

34:11.685 --> 34:13.600
there's a rumor in the town

34:13.710 --> 34:15.210
that a debate will be held soon.

34:15.485 --> 34:17.240
Celebrities of Jiangnan will attend it.

34:20.935 --> 34:22.110
The Lu Family isn't invited?

34:26.335 --> 34:27.335
Answer me.

34:27.960 --> 34:29.535
It'll be held by Liu Liting's wife.

34:29.800 --> 34:30.720
She has invited all scholars,

34:30.810 --> 34:32.785
except for the Lu Family.

34:33.110 --> 34:34.260
She said

34:35.160 --> 34:36.636
that the Lu Family had a bad reputation

34:36.660 --> 34:38.311
and wasn't qualified
to lead scholars of Jiangnan.

34:38.335 --> 34:39.585
She scolded me too, didn't she?

34:40.935 --> 34:41.935
Where will it be held?

34:42.310 --> 34:43.310
In Baoguo Temple.

34:43.635 --> 34:44.920
What's the topic of the debate?

34:45.535 --> 34:46.985
About the reign of kings.

34:47.835 --> 34:48.835
Good topic.

34:48.985 --> 34:50.735
Will Xu Fengnian really come?

34:51.060 --> 34:53.135
Xu Xiao is in the capital now.

34:53.285 --> 34:54.285
What?

34:54.385 --> 34:56.160
His Majesty hasn't seen him yet.

34:57.835 --> 34:59.896
What does it have to do
with Xu Fengnian?

34:59.920 --> 35:02.920
Do you know why Xu Fengnian
came to Jiangnan?

35:03.285 --> 35:05.696
To see his shameless sister.

35:05.720 --> 35:06.960
He came to make trouble.

35:08.035 --> 35:09.035
Don't worry.

35:09.410 --> 35:10.680
In the debate in Baoguo Temple,

35:11.560 --> 35:14.745
Xu Fengnian will appear.

35:22.760 --> 35:23.760
Your Highness.

35:31.635 --> 35:32.635
Get out of town tomorrow.

35:32.680 --> 35:33.680
We're leaving?

35:35.560 --> 35:36.960
Qingniao will escort you out first.

35:37.285 --> 35:39.005
Let's meet in Baoguo Temple
out of the town.

35:39.035 --> 35:39.976
Are we going there for burning incense?

35:40.000 --> 35:41.000
For a quarrel.

35:43.185 --> 35:44.320
Come in with me for a talk.

35:57.660 --> 35:58.660
What's wrong?

36:02.360 --> 36:03.560
Don't let them hear us.

36:14.035 --> 36:14.737
It's all right.

36:14.761 --> 36:16.360
Wait in the yard.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.110
We're alone now.

36:28.935 --> 36:30.060
Do you remember the day

36:31.520 --> 36:32.960
when my mother died?

36:34.335 --> 36:35.335
Yes.

36:40.885 --> 36:42.410
(Memorial)

36:44.835 --> 36:47.935
(Tablet of Wife Wu Su)

37:05.335 --> 37:07.400
She'll always live in your heart,

37:07.560 --> 37:08.835
watching you.

37:09.510 --> 37:10.377
Wipe your tears.

37:10.401 --> 37:12.000
Don't let her see you cry.

37:21.985 --> 37:23.435
You told me

37:24.785 --> 37:26.640
that my mother would live in my heart.

37:29.310 --> 37:30.336
Since then,

37:30.360 --> 37:31.600
I've never cried.

37:34.410 --> 37:35.635
I tried

37:37.010 --> 37:38.435
to take care of Huangman'er

37:40.160 --> 37:41.600
and my sisters.

37:43.760 --> 37:45.600
I wanted to protect them
on behalf of my mother

37:47.010 --> 37:48.840
so that my family would not fall apart.

37:52.735 --> 37:55.080
But in the end, I failed.

37:58.035 --> 38:00.285
My eldest sister
was married to Jiangnan.

38:01.085 --> 38:02.185
My second eldest sister

38:02.760 --> 38:04.360
went to Shangyin Academy.

38:05.985 --> 38:08.535
Even Huangman'er was forcibly sent
to Mount Longhu.

38:10.660 --> 38:12.240
My family fell apart, anyway.

38:12.635 --> 38:14.435
As long as you become
the Lord of North Liang,

38:15.810 --> 38:17.385
you can get them back.

38:20.185 --> 38:21.510
But I'm afraid it's too late.

38:21.760 --> 38:22.910
Why?

38:25.110 --> 38:26.585
My sister has been taking medicine.

38:29.085 --> 38:30.560
I worried about her

38:32.185 --> 38:35.600
and I consulted famous doctors
in Yangcheng.

38:36.835 --> 38:37.935
What did they say?

38:40.085 --> 38:41.365
There's no cure for her.

38:58.785 --> 38:59.785
My Lady,

39:00.235 --> 39:01.760
His Highness is leaving.

39:03.010 --> 39:04.050
Will you not

39:05.110 --> 39:06.320
tell him about your disease?

39:08.435 --> 39:09.785
It is no use telling him.

39:11.310 --> 39:12.310
Er'qiao,

39:12.810 --> 39:14.535
help me to get changed.

39:19.260 --> 39:20.835
What disease does she have?

39:25.610 --> 39:26.710
According to the doctors,

39:27.060 --> 39:28.460
she has an insufficiency of spirit.

39:30.000 --> 39:31.320
It's a common disease.

39:31.985 --> 39:33.480
She just needs replenishment.

39:33.635 --> 39:34.685
She can't have it.

39:35.240 --> 39:36.360
What does that mean?

39:36.935 --> 39:38.910
Her spirit and strength

39:39.285 --> 39:41.110
are consuming faster than ordinary men.

39:42.135 --> 39:44.260
She's like a burning flame

39:45.635 --> 39:46.835
that will not stop

39:47.460 --> 39:48.710
until it burns out.

39:51.835 --> 39:53.035
It's not an exact disease.

39:54.410 --> 39:55.960
Her life

39:56.660 --> 39:58.510
is just burning faster.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.985
However much medicine she takes,

40:01.510 --> 40:02.990
it can't make up for her lost energy.

40:04.010 --> 40:06.360
It will only make her burn more brightly

40:07.560 --> 40:08.810
and die faster.

40:17.110 --> 40:18.110
How do I look?

40:18.960 --> 40:19.960
Do I look beautiful?

40:21.460 --> 40:23.460
This is my favorite dress.

40:23.835 --> 40:25.060
Fengnian is leaving.

40:25.610 --> 40:27.600
I want to make
the best impression on him.

40:28.200 --> 40:29.260
My Lady.

40:31.610 --> 40:32.760
Listen.

40:33.210 --> 40:35.160
Strength will be exhausted.

40:35.535 --> 40:36.760
In some cases,

40:37.010 --> 40:39.040
we can't find a solution.

40:39.435 --> 40:40.785
Don't let him know.

40:42.310 --> 40:44.920
I want him to leave Jiangnan
in high spirits.

40:45.185 --> 40:46.185
All right?

40:48.360 --> 40:49.360
Mm.

40:54.085 --> 40:55.711
Actually, I'm very happy

40:55.735 --> 40:57.385
to see Fengnian again.

40:58.835 --> 41:01.010
When I know he wants
to take over North Liang,

41:01.210 --> 41:02.610
I'm relieved, too.

41:03.635 --> 41:05.176
Now, I just wish

41:05.200 --> 41:07.000
I could live a bit longer

41:07.535 --> 41:08.976
so that I could see it

41:09.000 --> 41:11.080
when Fengnian becomes
the Lord of North Liang.

41:12.285 --> 41:14.535
Then, I would have no regret.

41:17.585 --> 41:19.265
Now that my sister
doesn't want me to know,

41:22.835 --> 41:24.320
I just pretend I don't know.

41:27.635 --> 41:28.656
I had wanted

41:28.680 --> 41:30.080
to take her back to North Liang.

41:33.185 --> 41:34.535
But my sister doesn't want it.

41:36.485 --> 41:37.935
She thinks

41:39.285 --> 41:41.640
she can't help me
unless she stays in Jiangnan.

41:44.160 --> 41:45.520
So, I must let her stay

41:45.585 --> 41:47.085
to make her happy.

41:50.635 --> 41:51.635
All right, then.

41:54.910 --> 41:56.135
If it's what my sister wants,

41:58.460 --> 41:59.520
I'll let her be.

42:02.360 --> 42:03.880
Let's keep looking for famous doctors.

42:04.385 --> 42:05.440
There's hope.

42:06.085 --> 42:08.760
I don't think doctors can't help her.

42:09.085 --> 42:10.280
Who else can help her?

42:13.610 --> 42:16.210
Li Chungang hasn't grown old
since he became famous for decades.

42:16.760 --> 42:18.296
Wang Xianzhi is known
as the Second Best.

42:18.320 --> 42:19.480
He's nearly 60 years old,

42:19.710 --> 42:21.150
but he looks like a middle-aged man.

42:21.635 --> 42:22.840
Maybe they can help her.

42:24.185 --> 42:25.296
I'll go see Li Chungang

42:25.320 --> 42:26.520
and ask him for help.

42:27.260 --> 42:28.260
Forget it.

42:29.160 --> 42:30.660
I'm wrong about that.

42:31.760 --> 42:34.035
He's the God of Sword,
instead of the God of Medicine.

42:41.510 --> 42:42.800
I'm just

42:44.200 --> 42:45.535
a little bit disturbed.

42:46.710 --> 42:48.110
I guess

42:49.035 --> 42:50.960
I can sort myself out
when talking to you.

43:29.840 --> 43:32.560
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.335 --> 43:37.135
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.060 --> 43:41.980
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.060 --> 43:46.860
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.160 --> 43:51.060
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.760 --> 43:55.580
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.585 --> 44:00.340
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.360 --> 44:05.285
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.785 --> 44:08.516
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.540 --> 44:09.780
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.560 --> 44:14.420
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.235 --> 44:17.961
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.985 --> 44:19.420
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.910 --> 44:23.785
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.210 --> 44:25.561
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.585 --> 44:28.420
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.835 --> 44:31.316
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.340 --> 44:33.740
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.035 --> 44:36.061
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.085 --> 44:38.261
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.285 --> 44:42.500
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.860 --> 44:43.996
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.020 --> 44:47.060
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.235 --> 44:49.196
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.220 --> 44:51.940
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.500 --> 44:54.316
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.340 --> 44:56.836
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.860 --> 45:00.960
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
